OL,3,A'The reason we lost is the war,' JD
OL,4,AVance says after Democrats take control
OL,5,Aof Congress
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Democrats win the Senate and the
OL,8,FHouse in US midterm elections, taking
OL,9,Fcontrol of Congress for the rest of
OL,10,FDonald Trump's presidency
OL,12,F"The reason we lost is the war," says
OL,13,FUS Vice-President JD Vance - our
OL,14,FWashington correspondent calls it an
OL,15,Funusually candid assessment after
OL,16,Fmonths of backing the war in public
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
