OL,3,A'The reason we lost is the war,' JD
OL,4,AVance says after Democrats take control
OL,5,Aof Congress
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier, Trump also acknowledged the
OL,8,FIran war, and the rising cost of
OL,9,Fliving, were factors in his Republican
OL,10,FParty's defeat. Meanwhile, the White
OL,11,FHouse posted on social media: "Trump is
OL,12,Fstill your president"
OL,14,FIn Senate races, Democrats picked up a
OL,15,Fstring of victories in Republican
OL,16,Fstrongholds including Texas, South
OL,17,FCarolina and Kansas
OL,19,FTwo Senate races are still to be called
OL,20,F- in Alaska the process could take
OL,21,Fweeks while in Mississippi, 96% of the
OL,22,Fvotes have been counted
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
