OL,3,A'The reason we lost is the war,' JD
OL,4,AVance says after Democrats take control
OL,5,Aof Congress
OL,6,
OL,7,FTop Democrat in the House Hakeem
OL,8,FJeffries calls his party's victory a
OL,9,F"red, white and blue moment". Some
OL,10,Fseats in the lower chamber are still
OL,11,Fbeing counted, but the Democrats have
OL,12,Fsurpassed the 218 needed to win
